      "review_summary": "The PR forwards Discord reply policy metadata into the Discord send layer and suppresses native reply references on trailing chunks when `replyToMode` is single-use.\n\nPR surface: Source +20. Total +20 across 4 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. The linked issue is source-reproducible on current main because `sendDiscordText` and media caption follow-ups reuse the same `replyTo` across physical chunks, and the reporter provided instrumented Discord request logs.",
